        "@id": "https://ubuntu.com/security/notices/USN-7409-1",
        "name": "USN-7409-1",
        "description": "It was discovered that ruby-saml did not correctly handle XML parsing. An attacker could possibly use this issue to perform a signature  wrapping attack and bypass authentication. (CVE-2025-25291  and CVE-2025-25292)  It was discovered that ruby-saml did not correctly handle decompressing SAML responses. An attacker could possibly use this issue to cause a denial of service. (CVE-2025-25293)",
        "aliases": [
          "CVE-2025-25291",
          "CVE-2025-25292",
          "CVE-2025-25293"
        ]
      },
